{"seq":3,"slug":"visualization","title":"数据可视化 Matplotlib/Plotly","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/data-science/visualization","wordCount":1159,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"数据可视化-matplotlib-plotly\">数据可视化 Matplotlib/Plotly</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>数据可视化将数据转化为图形，帮助发现模式、验证假设和传达结论。Python 可视化生态以 Matplotlib 为基础，Seaborn 提供统计图表，Plotly 提供交互式可视化。选择合适的工具和图表类型，是有效数据表达的关键。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>可视化工具的分工可以直接对应到三个层次，选型时先问&quot;现在处于哪个阶段&quot;：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>库</th>\n<th>定位</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>适用阶段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Matplotlib</td>\n<td>底层绘图引擎</td>\n<td>定制能力极强、面向对象 API</td>\n<td>发表、精细控制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Seaborn</td>\n<td>统计可视化</td>\n<td>与 DataFrame 深度集成</td>\n<td>探索性分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Plotly</td>\n<td>交互式图表</td>\n<td>缩放/悬停/选择、HTML 输出</td>\n<td>仪表板、网页</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>两条贯穿始终的原则：<strong>一是表达诚实</strong>——坐标轴从零开始、比例一致、拒绝 3D 饼图这类扭曲面积的设计；<strong>二是面向目标选图</strong>——比较数量用柱状图、展示趋势用折线图、揭示分布用直方图/箱线图、探索相关性用散点图。图表类型由数据关系决定，而非由视觉偏好决定。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"matplotlib-基础\">Matplotlib 基础</h2><h3 id=\"基本绘图\">基本绘图</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import matplotlib.pyplot as plt&#10;import numpy as np&#10;&#10;x = np.linspace(0, 2 * np.pi, 100)&#10;y = np.sin(x)&#10;&#10;fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(8, 5))&#10;ax.plot(x, y, label=&quot;sin(x)&quot;, color=&quot;steelblue&quot;, linewidth=2)&#10;ax.set_xlabel(&quot;x&quot;)&#10;ax.set_ylabel(&quot;y&quot;)&#10;ax.set_title(&quot;正弦函数&quot;)&#10;ax.legend()&#10;ax.grid(True, alpha=0.3)&#10;plt.tight_layout()&#10;plt.savefig(&quot;plot.png&quot;, dpi=150)&#10;plt.show()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> matplotlib.pyplot </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> plt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.linspace(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.pi, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">y </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.sin(x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">fig, ax </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> plt.subplots(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">figsize</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ax.plot(x, y, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">label</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sin(x)\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">color</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"steelblue\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">linewidth</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ax.set_xlabel(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"x\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ax.set_ylabel(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"y\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ax.set_title(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"正弦函数\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ax.legend()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ax.grid(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">alpha</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">plt.tight_layout()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">plt.savefig(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"plot.png\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dpi</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">150</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">plt.show()</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Matplotlib 有两套 API：过程式（<code>plt.plot()</code>）和面向对象式（<code>fig, ax = plt.subplots()</code>）。面向对象式 API 在多子图、复杂布局、自定义样式等场景中更加灵活可控。建议从入门开始就使用面向对象 API，避免在复杂场景中被过程式 API 的隐式状态管理困扰。</p>\n<h3 id=\"子图布局\">子图布局</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"fig, axes = plt.subplots(2, 2, figsize=(10, 8))&#10;axes[0, 0].bar([&quot;A&quot;, &quot;B&quot;, &quot;C&quot;], [10, 20, 15])&#10;axes[0, 1].scatter(np.random.randn(50), np.random.randn(50))&#10;axes[1, 0].hist(np.random.randn(1000), bins=30)&#10;axes[1, 1].pie([30, 40, 30], labels=[&quot;X&quot;, &quot;Y&quot;, &quot;Z&quot;])&#10;plt.tight_layout()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">fig, axes </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> plt.subplots(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">figsize</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">axes[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].bar([</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"A\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"B\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"C\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">15</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">axes[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].scatter(np.random.randn(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), np.random.randn(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">axes[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].hist(np.random.randn(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">bins</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">axes[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].pie([</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">40</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">labels</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"X\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Y\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">plt.tight_layout()</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"常用图表类型\">常用图表类型</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>图表类型</th>\n<th>函数</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>折线图</td>\n<td><code>ax.plot()</code></td>\n<td>趋势变化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>柱状图</td>\n<td><code>ax.bar()</code></td>\n<td>分类比较</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>散点图</td>\n<td><code>ax.scatter()</code></td>\n<td>相关性分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>直方图</td>\n<td><code>ax.hist()</code></td>\n<td>分布特征</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>箱线图</td>\n<td><code>ax.boxplot()</code></td>\n<td>离群值检测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>热力图</td>\n<td><code>ax.imshow()</code></td>\n<td>相关矩阵</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>饼图</td>\n<td><code>ax.pie()</code></td>\n<td>占比分析</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>选择图表类型时应基于数据关系而非视觉偏好：比较数量用柱状图、展示趋势用折线图、揭示分布用直方图/箱线图、探索相关性用散点图。避免使用 3D 饼图——它扭曲面积比例，降低数据可读性。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"seaborn-统计可视化\">Seaborn 统计可视化</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import seaborn as sns&#10;&#10;tips = sns.load_dataset(&quot;tips&quot;)&#10;&#10;fig, axes = plt.subplots(1, 3, figsize=(15, 5))&#10;sns.histplot(data=tips, x=&quot;total_bill&quot;, kde=True, ax=axes[0])&#10;sns.boxplot(data=tips, x=&quot;day&quot;, y=&quot;total_bill&quot;, ax=axes[1])&#10;sns.scatterplot(data=tips, x=&quot;total_bill&quot;, y=&quot;tip&quot;, hue=&quot;smoker&quot;, ax=axes[2])&#10;plt.tight_layout()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> seaborn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sns</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tips </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sns.load_dataset(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tips\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">fig, axes </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> plt.subplots(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">figsize</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">15</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sns.histplot(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tips, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">x</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"total_bill\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">kde</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ax</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">axes[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sns.boxplot(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tips, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">x</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"day\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">y</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"total_bill\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ax</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">axes[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sns.scatterplot(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tips, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">x</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"total_bill\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">y</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tip\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">hue</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"smoker\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ax</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">axes[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">plt.tight_layout()</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"seaborn-图表速查\">Seaborn 图表速查</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>函数</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>histplot()</code></td>\n<td>直方图</td>\n<td>支持 KDE 密度估计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>boxplot()</code></td>\n<td>箱线图</td>\n<td>自动按分类变量分组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>violinplot()</code></td>\n<td>小提琴图</td>\n<td>分布形状更直观</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>heatmap()</code></td>\n<td>热力图</td>\n<td>相关矩阵可视化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>pairplot()</code></td>\n<td>配对图</td>\n<td>多变量关系一览</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>lmplot()</code></td>\n<td>回归图</td>\n<td>带拟合线的散点图</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Seaborn 的核心优势是与 Pandas DataFrame 的深度集成——直接传入 DataFrame 和列名即可绑定数据，无需手动提取数组。通过 <code>hue</code>、<code>size</code>、<code>style</code> 参数可以在同一张图中同时编码多个维度的信息，大幅提升信息密度。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"plotly-交互式可视化\">Plotly 交互式可视化</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import plotly.express as px&#10;&#10;df = px.data.gapminder()&#10;fig = px.scatter(&#10;    df.query(&quot;year == 2007&quot;),&#10;    x=&quot;gdpPercap&quot;,&#10;    y=&quot;lifeExp&quot;,&#10;    size=&quot;pop&quot;,&#10;    color=&quot;continent&quot;,&#10;    hover_name=&quot;country&quot;,&#10;    log_x=True,&#10;    title=&quot;2007 年全球人均 GDP vs 预期寿命&quot;,&#10;)&#10;fig.show()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> plotly.express </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> px</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">df </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> px.data.gapminder()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">fig </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> px.scatter(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    df.query(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"year == 2007\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    x</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"gdpPercap\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    y</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"lifeExp\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pop\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    color</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"continent\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    hover_name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"country\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    log_x</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    title</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2007 年全球人均 GDP vs 预期寿命\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">fig.show()</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"plotly-vs-matplotlib\">Plotly vs Matplotlib</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>Matplotlib</th>\n<th>Plotly</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>交互性</td>\n<td>静态图</td>\n<td>缩放、悬停、选择</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>输出格式</td>\n<td>PNG/SVG/PDF</td>\n<td>HTML/JSON</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>学习曲线</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>低（express API）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定制能力</td>\n<td>极强</td>\n<td>强</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>论文、报告</td>\n<td>仪表板、网页展示</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"图表设计原则\">图表设计原则</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>原则</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>反例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据墨水比</td>\n<td>最大化数据信息，最小化装饰</td>\n<td>3D 饼图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>诚实表达</td>\n<td>坐标轴从零开始，比例一致</td>\n<td>截断 Y 轴夸大差异</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>色彩无障碍</td>\n<td>使用色盲友好的调色板</td>\n<td>红绿对比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标签完整</td>\n<td>标题、轴标签、图例、单位</td>\n<td>无标签的裸图</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  A[确定分析目标] --&gt; B[选择图表类型]&#10;  B --&gt; C[准备数据]&#10;  C --&gt; D[绑定视觉通道]&#10;  D --&gt; E[添加标注和样式]&#10;  E --&gt; F[导出发布]\">graph LR\n  A[确定分析目标] --&gt; B[选择图表类型]\n  B --&gt; C[准备数据]\n  C --&gt; D[绑定视觉通道]\n  D --&gt; E[添加标注和样式]\n  E --&gt; F[导出发布]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"样式与主题\">样式与主题</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"plt.style.use(&quot;seaborn-v0_8-whitegrid&quot;)&#10;&#10;sns.set_theme(style=&quot;whitegrid&quot;, palette=&quot;muted&quot;, font_scale=1.2)&#10;&#10;import plotly.io as pio&#10;pio.templates.default = &quot;plotly_white&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">plt.style.use(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"seaborn-v0_8-whitegrid\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sns.set_theme(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">style</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"whitegrid\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">palette</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"muted\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">font_scale</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> plotly.io </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pio</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pio.templates.default </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"plotly_white\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p>统一的视觉主题对于发布质量的图表至关重要。建议团队定义一套标准的配色方案和字号规范，封装为可复用的主题配置。Matplotlib 支持通过 <code>rcParams</code> 全局设置或自定义 <code>.mplstyle</code> 文件来标准化图表外观。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><ul>\n<li>探索阶段用 Plotly Express 快速迭代，发表阶段用 Matplotlib 精细控制</li>\n<li>使用 <code>fig, ax = plt.subplots()</code> 面向对象 API 替代 <code>plt.plot()</code> 过程式 API</li>\n<li>导出高分辨率图片时设置 <code>dpi=300</code></li>\n<li>使用 Seaborn 的 <code>hue</code> / <code>style</code> 参数在同一图中编码多个维度</li>\n<li>交互式图表使用 Plotly 的 <code>fig.write_html()</code> 导出为独立 HTML 文件</li>\n<li>选择色盲友好的调色板（如 <code>colorblind</code>、<code>viridis</code>），确保图表的无障碍可读性</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>三库分工：Matplotlib 是底层引擎，Seaborn 面向统计探索，Plotly 面向交互展示。</li>\n<li>Matplotlib 推荐面向对象 API（<code>fig, ax = plt.subplots()</code>），复杂布局更可控。</li>\n<li>图表类型由数据关系决定：比较用柱状、趋势用折线、分布用直方/箱线、相关性用散点。</li>\n<li>设计原则：数据墨水比最大、诚实表达、色彩无障碍、标签完整。</li>\n<li>Seaborn 借 <code>hue</code> / <code>style</code> 在同一图中编码多个维度。</li>\n<li>统一主题（<code>rcParams</code> / <code>.mplstyle</code>）对发布质量至关重要，色盲友好调色板保障可读性。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"数据可视化 Matplotlib/Plotly","id":"数据可视化-matplotlib-plotly"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Matplotlib 基础","id":"matplotlib-基础"},{"level":3,"text":"基本绘图","id":"基本绘图"},{"level":3,"text":"子图布局","id":"子图布局"},{"level":2,"text":"常用图表类型","id":"常用图表类型"},{"level":2,"text":"Seaborn 统计可视化","id":"seaborn-统计可视化"},{"level":3,"text":"Seaborn 图表速查","id":"seaborn-图表速查"},{"level":2,"text":"Plotly 交互式可视化","id":"plotly-交互式可视化"},{"level":3,"text":"Plotly vs Matplotlib","id":"plotly-vs-matplotlib"},{"level":2,"text":"图表设计原则","id":"图表设计原则"},{"level":2,"text":"样式与主题","id":"样式与主题"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Pandas 数据处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/data-science/pandas"},"next":{"title":"Jupyter 与交互式分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/data-science/jupyter"}}